<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμείγνῡμι</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-ύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mix in, combine</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμειγνύντας
				τούς τε μετοίκους κτλ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				580
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φροντίδα καταμείξας . . εἰς τὸν
					ὅμοιον ἀέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					230
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν προῖκα εἰς τὴν οὐσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					30.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ εἰς ὑμᾶς αὐτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					25.63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμπόταις ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.148a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρα τοῖς φυτοῖς</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				648c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἀναγκαίοις ἀρετῆς τινα ζῆλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμεμειγμένον ἐς τὸν ἠέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτοις καταμεμεῖχθαι τοιαύτην δύναμιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Spir.</u>
					485b10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ στρατιῶται εἰς τὰς πόλεις
				κατεμείγνυντο</span>, i.e. <i>were mingled</i> with the
			citizens, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.2.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			.</div>
